@startuml
skinparam NoteTextAlignment left
skinparam Padding 2
skinparam ParticipantPadding 50
skinparam LifelineStrategy solid

participant "Sever\n(subscriber)" as Sub
participant "Subscription Server" as Srv
participant "FHIR Source\n(may be the same Server)" as Data

== Subscription setup ==
Sub -> Srv: Discover SubscriptionTopic(s)
return Topic with ""backport-related-query"" extension
Sub -> Srv: Request a Subscription
return ""active"" Subscription

== Notification (push) ==
Srv -> Sub: Notification Bundle\n(SubscriptionStatus + ""related-query"")
note left of Sub
  Notification carries:
  * subscription id
  * focus resource id(s)
  * pre-coordinated query URL
  * query type (Coding)
end note

== Subsequent (pull) query ==
Sub -> Data: GET <query URL>\n(from the related-query in the Notification)
return Requested data
@enduml